('grig','Grig','Grig','1','Tiny','Fey','Always neutral good','1/2 d6+1 (2 hp)',2,'+4','20 ft. (4 squares), fly 40 ft. (poor)','18 (+2 size, +4 Dex, +2 natural), touch 16, flat-footed 16','+0/–11','Short sword +6 melee (1d3–3/19–20) or longbow +6 ranged (1d4–3/x3)','2-1/2 ft./0 ft.','+1','+6','+3',5,18,13,10,13,14,'Craft (any one) +4, Escape Artist +8, Hide +16, Jump +3, Listen +3, Move Silently +8*, Perform (string instruments) +6, Search +2, Spot +3','DodgeB, Weapon Finesse','{"special_attacks":"Spell-like abilities, fiddle","special_qualities":"Damage reduction 5/cold iron, low-light vision, spell resistance 17"}'::jsonb,'Grigs can leap great distances. They have light blue skin, forest-green hair, and brown hairy legs, and usually wear tunics or brightly colored vests with buttons made from tiny gems. A grig stands 1-1/2 feet tall and weighs about 1 pound.

